I have come to the conclusion that as a Valk/Sam/Knight your first wish is 
dependant upon what you already have.  So prior to Sokoban, I will most 
likely wish for a Cloak of Magic Resistance, since I can get reflection at 
either Medusa or Sokoban.  The cloak helps keep me from getting fried by 
traps or other nasties.  If I don't get reflection by Medusa, I descend 
blindfolded to get an idea of what is on each level.  If anything is 
particularly nasty, I do a search of some prior levels and see if there is 
anything I missed, or hopefully a random monster will drop something.

I've considered robes for these classes, but I have never considered that a 
high enough priority for a wish.  Regarding wishing for other classes 
artifacts, I have never considered getting MR through those means. 




